  "description": "<p data-start=\"22\" data-end=\"261\">UFC 2 is een vechtgame gebaseerd op de Ultimate Fighting Championship. In de game neem je het op tegen andere vechters in realistische MMA-gevechten en gebruik je verschillende vechtstijlen zoals boksen, kickboksen, worstelen en grappling.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"263\" data-end=\"272\"><strong data-start=\"263\" data-end=\"272\">Staat</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"274\" data-end=\"288\">In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"290\" data-end=\"301\">⭐ Voordelen</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"303\" data-end=\"456\">• Realistische MMA vechtgame<br data-start=\"331\" data-end=\"334\">• Verschillende vechtstijlen en technieken<br data-start=\"376\" data-end=\"379\">• Grote selectie UFC vechters<br data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"411\">• Geschikt voor singleplayer en multiplayer</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"474\">📋 Specificaties</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"653\"><strong data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"489\">Platform:</strong> Xbox One<br data-start=\"498\" data-end=\"501\"><strong data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"511\">Titel:</strong> UFC 2<br data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"520\"><strong data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"530\">Genre:</strong> Fighting / Sport<br data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"550\"><strong data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"564\">Spelmodus:</strong> Singleplayer / Multiplayer<br data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"594\"><strong data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"607\">Uitgever:</strong> Electronic Arts<br data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"626\"><strong data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"636\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"669\">📦 Meegeleverd</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"699\">Game disc<br data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"683\">Origineel doosje</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"719\">🛡️ Incl. Garantie</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"753\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</p>",
